10116.companyProfileEn:
Jiangsu Yilida Water Treatment Equipment Co., Ltd. — Data Center Water System Solutions Provider

Founded in 2004, Jiangsu Yilida is a high-tech enterprise integrating R&D, manufacturing, sales, installation & commissioning, and after-sales service. Headquartered in Jiangyin, Jiangsu Province, with a site of about 15,000 m², the company maintains a long-standing industry-university-research partnership with East China University of Science and Technology, exports products worldwide, and has specialized in water treatment equipment manufacturing for over 20 years.

For data centers, we deliver complete systems across the full water chain — makeup water treatment → cooling water conditioning → water reuse → ultrapure water for liquid cooling:

· Makeup water treatment: reverse osmosis (RO), ultrafiltration (UF), water softeners, and mechanical filters — desalinate and soften cooling makeup water to raise cycles of concentration;
· Cooling water conditioning: sidestream filtration, self-cleaning filters, chemical dosing systems, and online condenser cleaning — scale & corrosion inhibition and Legionella control;
· Water reuse: RO + UF to recover cooling tower blowdown and RO concentrate, directly lowering WUE (Water Usage Effectiveness);
· Liquid cooling support: TOC removal units, UV disinfection, makeup / pressurization units, water manifolds, and plate heat exchanger skids.

